<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Oct PPI rises 3.3 pct - government.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Oct PPI rises 3.3 pct - government.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's producer price index (PPI) rose 3.3 percent in October on the year, down from a 3.9 percent year-on-year rise a year earlier, Ministry of Finance and Economy figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					   Oct	Sept     Oct 95</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, yr-on-yr)	    +3.3     +2.3	+3.9</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, month-to-month)    +0.2     +0.4	-0.8</p>
<p>    PPI (base=1990)		 121.1    120.9     117.2</p>
<p>The ministry said the producer price index (PPI) rose 3.4 percent for the whole of 1995, against 3.9 percent in 1994.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
</text>
